ES:
¡Eh, hola! ¡Estoy aquí!
¡Déjame entrar, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
¿Estás ahí dentro?{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

IT:
Ehi, di casa! Sono qui fuori!
Fammi entrare! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
Ci sei o no?{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

ES:
¡Venga! ¿Es que no estás ahí
dentro? ¡Pues nada! ¡Supongo
que volveré luego!{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

IT:
Andiamo! Vuoi farmi credere che
non sei in casa? OK! Proverò
a ripassare!{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

DE:
Komm schon!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bist du daheim oder
nicht?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Na gut!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Dann komm ich eben
später wieder!{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

Hey ho!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ich weiß, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}ich komme uneingeladen...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Aber ich wollte mit dir rumhängen!

Tut mir leid, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}dass ich dich spontan
überfalle, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich freu mich,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
dass wir zwei zusammen rumhängen.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Did I surprise you by popping in all
of a sudden?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}} I was passing by, so I
decided to say hi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Te he sorprendido al aparecer así
de pronto?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}} Pasaba por aquí y me
apeteció saludarte,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Non ti aspettavi di vedermi, vero?
{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ero da queste parti e ho deciso di
passare a salutarti,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Böyle ansızın çıkagelince şaşırdın mı?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}
Buralardan geçiyordum, ben de bir selam
vereyim dedim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich war grad in der Gegend und
wollte dich unbedingt mal wieder
sehen! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Du bist doch nicht beschäftigt,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
oder?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Haha!{{TAG:0003:0000:}} {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}Ich bin nicht der Sensibelste.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du musst mir sagen, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}wenn ich störe!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tam evinin önünden geçiyordum, ben de
uğrayıp seninle takılayım dedim! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}
Zaten bir şey yapmıyordun, değil mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}
Ha ha! Dünyanın en düşünceli insanı
ben değil miyim?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ich komme ohne jede Vorwarnung...
{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}Trotzdem bist du nicht überrascht!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Deshalb mag ich dich, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}İnsanlar ya odasını hep düzenli tutar,
ya da dağınıklığı hiç umursamaz{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}
İşte ancak bu iki tip insan birini
çat kapı evine buyur eder!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, don't worry about feeding me!
I'm sure you don't have my brand of
protein shakes anyway{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aa, bana bir şeyler hazırlamana hiç gerek
yok! Zaten benim içtiğim protein
karışımından sende yoktur{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh! Ti va di provare questa delizia?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Io ho il fisico che mi ritrovo
grazie a quello che mangio!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002C:}}Ta-daaa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Forza, assaggia! Non hai niente
da perdere... e tutto da guadagnare,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pekâlâ! Yakında gitsem iyi olacak,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Benimle takılmama izin
